msgid "<qt>This is the preferences menu for the file dialog. Various options can be accessed from this menu including: <ul><li>how files are sorted in the list</li><li>types of view, including icon and list</li><li>showing of hidden files</li><li>the Places panel</li><li>file previews</li><li>separating folders from files</li></ul></qt>"
